{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-agent-swarm","title":"多智能体协同","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/claude-code-architecture/agent-and-task/multi-agent-swarm","wordCount":1050,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"多智能体协同\">多智能体协同</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>Coordinator 模式</strong>是多 agent 协同的核心：一个 leader 负责规划与分发，多个 worker 并行执行。关键在于<strong>权限不对称</strong>——leader 只保留最小工具集（<code>Agent</code>/<code>TaskStop</code>/<code>SendMessage</code>/<code>SyntheticOutput</code>），worker 才拿到完整权限。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const COORDINATOR_MODE_ALLOWED_TOOLS = [&#39;Agent&#39;, &#39;TaskStop&#39;, &#39;SendMessage&#39;, &#39;SyntheticOutput&#39;];&#10;// leader: 上面的最小集  ·  worker: 其余全部工具\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COORDINATOR_MODE_ALLOWED_TOOLS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Agent'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TaskStop'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SendMessage'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SyntheticOutput'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// leader: 上面的最小集  ·  worker: 其余全部工具</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>任务状态</td>\n<td>Teammate 各自的进度与健康</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Retain/Evict</td>\n<td>内存管理：保留活跃者、淘汰闲置者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Inbox</td>\n<td>agent 之间的消息传递通道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视图管理</td>\n<td>在终端里呈现多 agent 的实时状态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>要点：</strong> leader 被剥夺大部分工具，是为了让它专注协调而非亲自干活——否则「领导」会退化成「一个慢的独行者」。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"coordinator-模式架构\">Coordinator 模式架构</h2><p>Coordinator 模式是 Claude Code 多 agent 协同的核心模式：一个 leader agent 负责任务规划和分发，多个 worker agent 并行执行具体任务。Leader 只保留最小工具集，worker 获得完整工具访问权限。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const COORDINATOR_MODE_ALLOWED_TOOLS = [&#39;Agent&#39;, &#39;TaskStop&#39;, &#39;SendMessage&#39;, &#39;SyntheticOutput&#39;];&#10;&#10;interface CoordinatorConfig {&#10;  leaderTools: string[];&#10;  workerTools: string[];&#10;  maxConcurrentWorkers: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function buildCoordinatorConfig(): CoordinatorConfig {&#10;  return {&#10;    leaderTools: COORDINATOR_MODE_ALLOWED_TOOLS,&#10;    workerTools: getAllTools().filter((t) =&gt; !COORDINATOR_MODE_ALLOWED_TOOLS.includes(t)),&#10;    maxConcurrentWorkers: 5,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COORDINATOR_MODE_ALLOWED_TOOLS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Agent'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TaskStop'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SendMessage'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SyntheticOutput'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CoordinatorConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  leaderTools</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  workerTools</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxConcurrentWorkers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildCoordinatorConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CoordinatorConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    leaderTools: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COORDINATOR_MODE_ALLOWED_TOOLS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    workerTools: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getAllTools</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COORDINATOR_MODE_ALLOWED_TOOLS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    maxConcurrentWorkers: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    LEADER[&quot;Leader Agent&lt;br/&gt;(Agent, TaskStop, SendMessage, SyntheticOutput)&quot;] --&gt; W1[&quot;Worker Agent 1&lt;br/&gt;(全部工具 - 协调工具)&quot;]&#10;    LEADER --&gt; W2[&quot;Worker Agent 2&lt;br/&gt;(全部工具 - 协调工具)&quot;]&#10;    LEADER --&gt; W3[&quot;Worker Agent 3&lt;br/&gt;(全部工具 - 协调工具)&quot;]&#10;&#10;    W1 --&gt;|&quot;结果&quot;| LEADER&#10;    W2 --&gt;|&quot;结果&quot;| LEADER&#10;    W3 --&gt;|&quot;结果&quot;| LEADER&#10;&#10;    LEADER --&gt; OUTPUT[&quot;最终输出&quot;]&#10;\">graph TD\n    LEADER[\"Leader Agent&lt;br/&gt;(Agent, TaskStop, SendMessage, SyntheticOutput)\"] --&gt; W1[\"Worker Agent 1&lt;br/&gt;(全部工具 - 协调工具)\"]\n    LEADER --&gt; W2[\"Worker Agent 2&lt;br/&gt;(全部工具 - 协调工具)\"]\n    LEADER --&gt; W3[\"Worker Agent 3&lt;br/&gt;(全部工具 - 协调工具)\"]\n\n    W1 --&gt;|\"结果\"| LEADER\n    W2 --&gt;|\"结果\"| LEADER\n    W3 --&gt;|\"结果\"| LEADER\n\n    LEADER --&gt; OUTPUT[\"最终输出\"]\n</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>工具集</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Leader</td>\n<td>Agent, TaskStop, SendMessage, SyntheticOutput</td>\n<td>任务分解、分发、结果汇总</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Worker</td>\n<td>全部工具 - 协调工具</td>\n<td>具体任务执行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Leader 被限制为只能使用协调类工具，这防止了 leader 越过 worker 直接修改代码——保持了职责分离的架构原则。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>SyntheticOutput</code> 工具让 leader 能够合成最终输出而不需要实际执行任何操作，适合 leader 根据 worker 结果组装回答的场景。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"teammate-任务状态\">Teammate 任务状态</h2><p><code>InProcessTeammateTaskState</code> 扩展了基础任务状态，增加了消息队列、abort 控制器和阶段追踪，专门用于同进程内的 teammate 协作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface InProcessTeammateTaskState extends TaskStateBase {&#10;  type: &#39;in_process_teammate&#39;;&#10;  messages: Message[];&#10;  abortController: AbortController;&#10;  phase: TeammatePhase;&#10;  retainTranscript: boolean;&#10;  evictAfter?: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;type TeammatePhase = &#39;initializing&#39; | &#39;working&#39; | &#39;waiting&#39; | &#39;done&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InProcessTeammateTaskState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TaskStateBase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'in_process_teammate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  messages</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  abortController</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AbortController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  phase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TeammatePhase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  retainTranscript</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  evictAfter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TeammatePhase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'initializing'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'working'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'waiting'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'done'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; initializing&#10;    initializing --&gt; working : 收到首条消息&#10;    working --&gt; waiting : 等待指令&#10;    waiting --&gt; working : 收到新消息&#10;    working --&gt; done : 任务完成&#10;    waiting --&gt; done : 被终止&#10;&#10;    done --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; initializing\n    initializing --&gt; working : 收到首条消息\n    working --&gt; waiting : 等待指令\n    waiting --&gt; working : 收到新消息\n    working --&gt; done : 任务完成\n    waiting --&gt; done : 被终止\n\n    done --&gt; [*]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>messages</code></td>\n<td><code>Message[]</code></td>\n<td>与 leader 的消息历史</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>abortController</code></td>\n<td><code>AbortController</code></td>\n<td>取消当前推理的信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>phase</code></td>\n<td><code>TeammatePhase</code></td>\n<td>当前执行阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>retainTranscript</code></td>\n<td><code>boolean</code></td>\n<td>是否保留完整对话记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>evictAfter</code></td>\n<td><code>number?</code></td>\n<td>淘汰延迟时间戳（Unix ms）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>teammate 任务在同进程中运行，与 leader 通过消息队列实时通信，无需进程间通信（IPC）开销。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"retain-evict-内存管理\">Retain/Evict 内存管理</h2><p>Teammate 的对话记录采用 retain/evict 模式管理内存——查看 teammate 时保留完整对话（retain），离开视图后延迟淘汰（evict）以释放内存。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function retainTeammateTranscript(task: InProcessTeammateTaskState): void {&#10;  task.retainTranscript = true;&#10;  task.evictAfter = undefined;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function releaseTeammateTranscript(task: InProcessTeammateTaskState, gracePeriodMs: number = 30000): void {&#10;  task.retainTranscript = false;&#10;  task.evictAfter = Date.now() + gracePeriodMs;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function evictIfExpired(task: InProcessTeammateTaskState): void {&#10;  if (!task.retainTranscript &amp;&amp; task.evictAfter &amp;&amp; Date.now() &gt;= task.evictAfter) {&#10;    task.messages = [createStubMessage(task)];&#10;    task.evictAfter = undefined;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;function createStubMessage(task: InProcessTeammateTaskState): Message {&#10;  return {&#10;    role: &#39;system&#39;,&#10;    content: `[Transcript evicted. ${task.messages.length} messages were exchanged.]`,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> retainTeammateTranscript</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">task</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InProcessTeammateTaskState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  task.retainTranscript </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  task.evictAfter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> releaseTeammateTranscript</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">task</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InProcessTeammateTaskState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">gracePeriodMs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  task.retainTranscript </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"colo