() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> task.evictAfter) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    task.messages </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createStubMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(task)];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    task.evictAfter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createStubMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">task</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InProcessTeammateTaskState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    role: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'system'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    content: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`[Transcript evicted. ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">task</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">messages</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} messages were exchanged.]`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant User as 用户视图&#10;    participant TM as Teammate 任务&#10;    participant GC as 内存回收&#10;&#10;    User-&gt;&gt;TM: enterTeammateView()&#10;    TM-&gt;&gt;TM: retain = true&#10;    Note over TM: 完整对话可见&#10;&#10;    User-&gt;&gt;TM: exitTeammateView()&#10;    TM-&gt;&gt;TM: retain = false, evictAfter = now + 30s&#10;    Note over TM: 30 秒宽限期&#10;&#10;    GC-&gt;&gt;TM: evictIfExpired()&#10;    Note over GC,TM: 30 秒后&#10;    TM-&gt;&gt;TM: messages = [stub]&#10;    Note over TM: 对话被存根替换\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户视图\n    participant TM as Teammate 任务\n    participant GC as 内存回收\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;TM: enterTeammateView()\n    TM-&gt;&gt;TM: retain = true\n    Note over TM: 完整对话可见\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;TM: exitTeammateView()\n    TM-&gt;&gt;TM: retain = false, evictAfter = now + 30s\n    Note over TM: 30 秒宽限期\n\n    GC-&gt;&gt;TM: evictIfExpired()\n    Note over GC,TM: 30 秒后\n    TM-&gt;&gt;TM: messages = [stub]\n    Note over TM: 对话被存根替换</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th><code>retainTranscript</code></th>\n<th><code>evictAfter</code></th>\n<th>内存占用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>查看中</td>\n<td><code>true</code></td>\n<td><code>undefined</code></td>\n<td>完整对话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>宽限期</td>\n<td><code>false</code></td>\n<td>未来时间戳</td>\n<td>完整对话（临时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已淘汰</td>\n<td><code>false</code></td>\n<td><code>undefined</code></td>\n<td>仅存根消息</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>30 秒宽限期的设计考虑：用户可能短暂切出后立即切回查看 teammate 状态，宽限期避免了不必要的淘汰和重建。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 存根消息保留了对话的元信息（消息数量），让 leader 知道这个 teammate 曾经有过多少交互，有助于后续任务分配决策。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"inbox-消息传递\">Inbox 消息传递</h2><p>Leader 和 teammate 之间通过 <code>SendMessageTool</code> 实现双向消息传递，形成了一个简单的 inbox 通信模式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface SendMessageInput {&#10;  targetTaskId: string;&#10;  message: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function sendMessageCall(input: SendMessageInput, context: ToolUseContext): Promise&lt;ToolResult&lt;void&gt;&gt; {&#10;  const task = context.appState.tasks.get(input.targetTaskId);&#10;&#10;  if (!task || task.type !== &#39;in_process_teammate&#39;) {&#10;    return errorResult(undefined, &#39;Target task not found or not a teammate&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const teammateTask = task as InProcessTeammateTaskState;&#10;  teammateTask.messages.push({&#10;    role: &#39;user&#39;,&#10;    content: input.message,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  if (teammateTask.phase === &#39;waiting&#39;) {&#10;    teammateTask.phase = &#39;working&#39;;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return successResult(undefined);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SendMessageInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  targetTaskId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sendMessageCall</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SendMessageInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ToolUseContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ToolResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> task</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> context.appState.tasks.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input.targetTaskId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">task </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> task.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'in_process_teammate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> errorResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Target task not found or not a teammate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> teammateTask</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> task </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InProcessTeammateTaskState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  teammateTask.messages.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    role: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    content: input.message,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (teammateTask.phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'waiting'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    teammateTask.phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'working'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> successResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph Leader&#10;        L_SEND[&quot;SendMessage(targetId, msg)&quot;]&#10;        L_RECV[&quot;读取 teammate 结果&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph Teammate&#10;        T_INBOX[&quot;messages 队列&quot;]&#10;        T_WORK[&quot;执行任务&quot;]&#10;        T_REPLY[&quot;返回结果&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    L_SEND --&gt;|&quot;push message&quot;| T_INBOX&#10;    T_INBOX --&gt; T_WORK&#10;    T_WORK --&gt; T_REPLY&#10;    T_REPLY --&gt;|&quot;task result&quot;| L_RECV\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph Leader\n        L_SEND[\"SendMessage(targetId, msg)\"]\n        L_RECV[\"读取 teammate 结果\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Teammate\n        T_INBOX[\"messages 队列\"]\n        T_WORK[\"执行任务\"]\n        T_REPLY[\"返回结果\"]\n    end\n\n    L_SEND --&gt;|\"push message\"| T_INBOX\n    T_INBOX --&gt; T_WORK\n    T_WORK --&gt; T_REPLY\n    T_REPLY --&gt;|\"task result\"| L_RECV</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通信方向</th>\n<th>工具/机制</th>\n<th>消息格式</th>\n<th>触发行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Leader → TM</td>\n<td><code>SendMessageTool</code></td>\n<td>纯文本</td>\n<td>唤醒 waiting TM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TM → Leader</td>\n<td>Task result / Message</td>\n<td>ToolResult</td>\n<td>Leader 读取结果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>消息传递是异步的——leader 发送消息后不需要等待 teammate 处理完成，可以继续分发任务给其他 teammate。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"视图管理\">视图管理</h2><p><code>teammateViewHelpers.ts</code> 提供了 teammate 视图的进入和退出管理，确保同一时间只有一个 teammate 的对话处于&quot;被查看&quot;状态。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TeammateViewState {&#10;  activeTeammateId: string | null;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function enterTeammateView(viewState: TeammateViewState, task: InProcessTeammateTaskState): void {&#10;  if (viewState.activeTeammateId) {&#10;    const current = getTask(viewState.activeTeammateId);&#10;    if (current) releaseTeammateTranscript(current);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  viewState.activeTeammateId = task.id;&#10;  retainTeammateTranscript(task);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function exitTeammateView(viewState: TeammateViewState): void {&#10;  if (viewState.activeTeammateId) {&#10;    const task = getTask(viewState.activeTeammateId);&#10;    if (task) releaseTeammateTranscript(task);&#10;    viewState.activeTeammateId = null;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TeammateViewState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  activeTeammateId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> enterTeammateView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">viewState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TeammateViewState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">task</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InProcessTeammateTaskState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (viewState.activeTeammateId) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> current</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getTask</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(viewState.activeTeammateId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (current) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">releaseTeammateTranscript</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  viewState.activeTeammateId </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> task.id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  retainTeammateTranscript</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(task);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> exitTeammateView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">viewState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TeammateViewState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (viewState.activeTeammateId) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> task</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getTask</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(viewState.activeTeammateId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (task) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">releaseTeammateTranscript</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(task);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    viewState.activeTeammateId </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    ENTER[&quot;enterTeammateView(TM-B)&quot;] --&gt; CHECK{&quot;有活跃视图?&quot;}&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|&quot;是 (TM-A)&quot;| RELEASE_A[&quot;release TM-A 对话&quot;]&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|否| RETAIN_B[&quot;retain TM-B 对话&quot;]&#10;    RELEASE_A --&gt; RETAIN_B&#10;    RETAIN_B --&gt; ACTIVE[&quot;activeTeammateId = TM-B&quot;]&#10;&#10;    EXIT[&quot;exitTeammateView()&quot;] --&gt; RELEASE[&quot;release 当前 TM&quot;]&#10;    RELEASE --&gt; CLEAR[&quot;activeTeammateId = null&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    ENTER[\"enterTeammateView(TM-B)\"] --&gt; CHECK{\"有活跃视图?\"}\n    CHECK --&gt;|\"是 (TM-A)\"| RELEASE_A[\"release TM-A 对话\"]\n    CHECK --&gt;|否| RETAIN_B[\"retain TM-B 对话\"]\n    RELEASE_A --&gt; RETAIN_B\n    RETAIN_B --&gt; ACTIVE[\"activeTeammateId = TM-B\"]\n\n    EXIT[\"exitTeammateView()\"] --&gt; RELEASE[\"release 当前 TM\"]\n    RELEASE --&gt; CLEAR[\"activeTeammateId = null\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>对前一个 TM</th>\n<th>对目标 TM</th>\n<th>activeTeammateId</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>enter(TM-B)</td>\n<td>release(TM-A)</td>\n<td>retain(TM-B)</td>\n<td>TM-B</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>exit()</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>release(当前)</td>\n<td>null</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>切换视图时自动 release 前一个 teammate 的设计避免了内存泄漏——如果用户频繁在不同 teammate 间切换而不显式退出，所有 teammate 的对话都会驻留内存。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 视图管理的互斥设计（同一时间只有一个活跃 teammate）简化了 UI 渲染逻辑，但也意味着无法同时查看两个 teammate 的对话。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((多智能体协同))&#10;    Coordinator 模式&#10;      Leader 最小工具集&#10;      Worker 完整工具集&#10;      职责分离原则&#10;    Teammate 状态&#10;      InProcessTeammateTaskState&#10;      4 个执行阶段&#10;      消息队列 + abort&#10;    Retain/Evict&#10;      查看时 retain&#10;      离开后 30s evict&#10;      存根消息保留元信息&#10;    Inbox 消息&#10;      SendMessageTool&#10;      异步双向通信&#10;      唤醒 waiting teammate&#10;    视图管理&#10;      互斥活跃视图&#10;      自动 release 前一个&#10;      防止内存泄漏\">mindmap\n  root((多智能体协同))\n    Coordinator 模式\n      Leader 最小工具集\n      Worker 完整工具集\n      职责分离原则\n    Teammate 状态\n      InProcessTeammateTaskState\n      4 个执行阶段\n      消息队列 + abort\n    Retain/Evict\n      查看时 retain\n      离开后 30s evict\n      存根消息保留元信息\n    Inbox 消息\n      SendMessageTool\n      异步双向通信\n      唤醒 waiting teammate\n    视图管理\n      互斥活跃视图\n      自动 release 前一个\n      防止内存泄漏</pre><ul>\n<li>Coordinator 模式中 leader 仅拥有 <strong>4 个协调工具</strong>（Agent/TaskStop/SendMessage/SyntheticOutput），worker 获得全部非协调工具。</li>\n<li>Teammate 任务通过 <code>InProcessTeammateTaskState</code> 管理，包含<strong>消息队列、abort 控制器和阶段追踪</strong>。</li>\n<li>Retain/evict 模式在查看 teammate 时保留完整对话，退出后 <strong>30 秒宽限期</strong>后淘汰为存根消息。</li>\n<li>Leader 与 teammate 通过 <strong>SendMessageTool</strong> 异步通信，消息推送可唤醒处于 waiting 状态的 teammate。</li>\n<li>视图管理确保同一时间<strong>只有一个活跃 teammate</strong>，切换视图时自动 release 前一个以防内存泄漏。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多智能体协同","id":"多智能体协同"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Coordinator 模式架构","id":"coordinator-模式架构"},{"level":2,"text":"Teammate 任务状态","id":"teammate-任务状态"},{"level":2,"text":"Retain/Evict 内存管理","id":"retain-evict-内存管理"},{"level":2,"text":"Inbox 消息传递","id":"inbox-消息传递"},{"level":2,"text":"视图管理","id":"视图管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"任务生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/claude-code-architecture/agent-and-task/task-lifecycle"},"next":{"title":"技能与插件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/claude-code-architecture/agent-and-task/skill-and-plugin"}}